# Cursor Cloud Extra High

Use MCP `cloud_launch`, `cloud_status`, and `cloud_result` (or `scripts/launch-cloud-extra-high.sh`). Set `GCS_CLOUD_REPO` or `CLOUD_REPO_URL` before create. Do not print API keys. After `CLOUD_LAUNCH_OK`, a waiter A2A-pings the owning seat; do not block the Director turn on watch.

LIV-41: directors themselves invoke `cloud_launch`. Under 8 RUNNING Extra High per repo, a turn without a spawn is FAIL. Do not reuse `--name gcs-liv41-mind-must-launch`. Never Bot CloudAgent.
